<http://data.silknow.org/object/1d042c59-2f55-3f52-bc86-d81261e33df1>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Long shawl of silk gauze, printed. It has two long parallel panels at each end, with large and elaborate cone devices, and broad side borders filled with a close row of smaller but similar devices. There are narrower straight outer borders all around containing cartouches and rosettes, and a scalloped edging with flowers. The middle of each panel is plain black, and there are knotted black fringes at each end."@en , "printed silk gauze, 1855-65c, British; Long shawl, black ground"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/0c7aab2b-4c31-3230-bdb7-14791c51d5fd> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "printed silk gauze, 1855-65c, British; Long shawl, black ground"@en , "Long shawl of silk gauze, printed. It has two long parallel panels at each end, with large and elaborate cone devices, and broad side borders filled with a close row of smaller but similar devices. There are narrower straight outer borders all around containing cartouches and rosettes, and a scalloped edging with flowers. The middle of each panel is plain black, and there are knotted black fringes at each end."@en ;
